<title>HONG KONG: Tricom interim net falls 24.94 percent.</title>
<headline>Tricom interim net falls 24.94 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   3.0	 vs 4.1</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	 vs 1.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  2.49 loss vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    6.75	vs 8.99</p>
<p>    Turnover		     170.28    vs 192.81</p>
<p>    Company name		 Tricom Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - A supplier of telephone systems, office automation and personal communications products.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss of HK$2.49 million from cessation of its mobile phone distrubition business during the period.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
